# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Conan 2.x cpp_info.requires 引用系统库（libm）报 components 未定义 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-08
# Software: wren 0.4.0
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (conan create)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-wren-0.4.0-conan2-system-libs-requires
severity: 3
category: conan|recipe|packaging
trigger_tool: conan
phase: package
approach: 在 conanfile.py 的 package_info() 中，系统库（如 libm）必须写入
  self.cpp_info.system_libs，绝不能写进 self.cpp_info.requires——requires 只允许引用
  self.cpp_info.components 已定义的同包组件；按 name/version 引用外部 Conan 包依赖
  用 requirements() 的 self.requires(...)

keywords: cpp_info.requires, system_libs, libm, components, package_info, conan 2.x

error_signature: There are '\(cpp_info/components\)\.requires' to other internal components that are not defined: \['m'\]
match_keywords: cpp_info.requires, components not defined, system_libs, libm

root_cause: Conan 2.x 的 cpp_info.requires 字段语义是“本包内部组件间的依赖引用”，
  只接受 self.cpp_info.components 中已定义的组件名；配方作者把系统库（-lm）误写入
  requires 后，conan create 的 package_info() 阶段直接抛
  “There are '(cpp_info/components).requires' to other internal components that are
  not defined: ['m']” 错误。系统库应声明在 cpp_info.system_libs（链接期追加 -l 标志），
  外部 Conan 包依赖则放 requirements()
affected_scope: 所有链接 libm（或其他系统库）且手写 package_info() 的 Conan 2.x 配方；
  模板自动生成的配方若把系统库写入 requires 同样触发

rec_priority: 1
